#. あの２人は…
#. <CLT 3>最初から入れ替わってた<CLT>のかもしれないよ。
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The two of them...may have switched places <CLT 3>from the\n"
"very beginning<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. え…？　最初からって…？
msgctxt "0002 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "What...? From the beginning?"
msgstr ""

#. ボク達が最初に会った時からだよ…
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yes, from the moment we first met."
msgstr ""

#. あの時、すでに２人が入れ替わってたとすれば…
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "If that's when they switched..."
msgstr ""

#. 殺される瞬間に、入れ替わる必要もないはずだよね？
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"...then they wouldn't have had to switch at the moment\n"
"of death, right?"
msgstr ""

#. だって、あそこで殺されたのは、
#. すでに戦刃むくろだったんだからさ。
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"After all, the one we saw at that point would have\n"
"already been Mukuro."
msgstr ""

#. ま、待て…！　だとすると…
#. 俺らが会ってた、あの江ノ島っちも…！
msgctxt "0007 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"H-Hold on...! So you're saying the \"Junko\" we first\n"
"met..."
msgstr ""

#. 本当は…戦刃むくろだった…？
msgctxt "0008 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "...was actually Mukuro all along!?"
msgstr ""

#. じゃ、じゃ、じゃあ…！
#. あたし達は…戦刃むくろと会ってたって事…！？
msgctxt "0009 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Th-Then...we'd already met her!?"
msgstr ""

#. ていうか、私、普通に話してたよ！
msgctxt "0010 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I had, like, a normal conversation with her!"
msgstr ""

#. 俺達は、互いの素性を知らないまま出会った…
msgctxt "0011 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"When we first met, none of us knew who anyone else\n"
"was."
msgstr ""

#. だから、戦刃むくろが江ノ島盾子を名乗ったところで…
msgctxt "0012 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"So Mukuro could have simply told us her name was\n"
"Junko..."
msgstr ""

#. それに気付く事は、不可能だった。
msgctxt "0013 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "...and we never would have known the difference."
msgstr ""

#. そうやって、２人は最初から
#. 入れ替わっていたという事か…
msgctxt "0014 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"That would easily allow the two of them to switch\n"
"places from the very beginning."
msgstr ""

#. あ、でもさ、戦刃むくろって、
#. 手の甲に<CLT 3>タトゥー<CLT>があるんだよね！？
msgctxt "0015 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Wait, but Mukuro had a <CLT 3>tattoo<CLT> on the back of her\n"
"hand, right!?"
msgstr ""

#. だけど、あの時の江ノ島ちゃんには、
#. そんなタトゥーなんてなかったよ…？
msgctxt "0016 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Junko never had any tattoo like that, did she?"
msgstr ""

#. きっと、<CLT 3>ファンデーション<CLT>でも使って、
#. 隠しておいたんでしょうね…
msgctxt "0017 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"She could have hidden it with <CLT 3>foundation<CLT> or\n"
"something like that."
msgstr ""

#. それが爆発と消火の際に溶けて、
#. タトゥーが露わになったんじゃないかしら？
msgctxt "0018 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"If she did, it likely melted away in the explosion,\n"
"exposing the tattoo after the body was extinguished."
msgstr ""

#. ついでに言えば、戦刃むくろの死体の<CLT 3>つけ爪<CLT>は…
msgctxt "0019 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Plus, there were the <CLT 3>fake nails<CLT> found on the hands\n"
"of Mukuro's body."
msgstr ""

#. あの時の彼女と同じ、
#. <CLT 3>赤いつけ爪<CLT>だったはずよ。
msgctxt "0020 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"They were the same <CLT 3>fake red nails<CLT> she was wearing\n"
"when we all met for the first time."
msgstr ""

#. で、でも…ファンデーションを使ってたなら…
msgctxt "0021 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "B-But...if she really did use foundation..."
msgstr ""

#. そう…手の甲にタトゥーがないから、
#. 戦刃むくろじゃないとは言い切れなかったのよ…
msgctxt "0022 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Correct. Even if there was no tattoo on her hand, I\n"
"couldn't say for certain it wasn't Mukuro."
msgstr ""

#. だから、苗木君を襲撃した人物を特定する際、
#. あなたがその穴に気付かなくて助かったわ…
msgctxt "0023 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"So I'm glad nobody noticed that glaring hole when we\n"
"were trying to figure out who attacked Makoto..."
msgstr ""

#. 残念だったわね、モノクマ…
#. 今更、認めないと言っても遅いわよ。
msgctxt "0024 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But too bad for you, Monokuma. You can't deny it\n"
"anymore."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0025 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. じゃ、じゃあマジで…！
#. 全部…最初から仕組まれてたんか…！？
msgctxt "0026 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Wait, so...! This whole thing was a set-up from\n"
"the very beginning!?"
msgstr ""

#. それにしても、なかなか手の込んだ計画だ…
#. 戦刃むくろに江ノ島盾子のフリをさせていたとは…
msgctxt "0027 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If that's true, it was quite an elaborate plan, to be\n"
"sure. Making it look like Mukuro was Junko..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0028 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. そこまで手の込んだ計画が可能だったのは、
#. その２人が組んでいたからこそよ。
msgctxt "0029 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The reason such an elaborate plan was possible is\n"
"because the two of them were working together."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>“超高校級の絶望”<CLT>である戦刃むくろ…
#. そんな彼女と組んでたって事は…
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So Mukuro, the <CLT 3>Ultimate Despair<CLT>, teamed up with\n"
"someone like her..."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、江ノ島盾子も<CLT 3>“超高校級の絶望”の１人<CLT>だと
#. 考えられるはずだよ！
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"In other words, it would be fair to say that Junko\n"
"herself was also the <CLT 3>Ultimate Despair<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0032 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …どうしたの？　反論する気力もなくなった？
msgctxt "0033 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "What's wrong? Lost the will to fight back?"
msgstr ""

#. ビビッてる…だけだよ…
msgctxt "0034 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I think he's just afraid..."
msgstr ""

#. ビビる？　ビビるって何…？
msgctxt "0035 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Afraid? What's that mean, afraid?"
msgstr ""

#. 怯えや恐怖…それは希望があるからこそ抱く感情…
#. 絶望しかないボクには無縁な感情だよ。
msgctxt "0036 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Fear is only possible where hope is possible. I only\n"
"have despair, so fear is an alien concept to me."
msgstr ""

#. それなら、なぜ黙っている？
msgctxt "0037 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Then why haven't you been saying anything?"
msgstr ""

#. だってさ、バカバカしいんだもん。
#. ボクの正体が江ノ島盾子だなんて…
msgctxt "0038 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Because it's a bunch of nonsense. Junko's my secret\n"
"identity?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷぷ…そんな訳ないじゃん！
msgctxt "0039 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Puhuhu! As if!"
msgstr ""

#. だったら、お前はどうして、
#. 本物の江ノ島盾子の素性を隠そうとしたんだ…？
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Then why did you try and protect Junko's real\n"
"identity?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0041 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. …ボクが江ノ島さんの素性を隠そうとした？
msgctxt "0042 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "I tried to protect her identity?"
msgstr ""

#. いつ…そんな事したって言うのさ？
msgctxt "0043 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "When did I do that?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>やっぱり、認めないつもりか…
#. でも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So he still refuses to admit it. But...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いくら誤魔化そうとしても無駄だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He can try to deceive us all he wants, it doesn't\n"
"matter.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だって…ボクはもう気付いているんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Because I've already figured it out...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>待てよ…
#. 今はこれよりも…あの証拠の方が先だな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hold on. What matters now is presenting the right\n"
"evidence...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>“捜査の時”に、モノクマが
#. ボクから隠そうとした…あれだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It has to do with what Monokuma tried to keep me from\n"
"seeing during the investigation...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい？　それがどうかしたの？
msgctxt "0050 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Okay? And?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これじゃ…モノクマを追い詰める事は
#. 出来ないみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I...don't think this is what I need to corner\n"
"Monokuma...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あれあれ？
#. もしかして勢いだけで言っちゃった系？
msgctxt "0053 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"Wait, what? Were you just going with the flow or\n"
"something?"
msgstr ""

#. 違うわ。
#. なにか根拠がある、そうよね苗木君？
msgctxt "0054 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"No, we definitely have the proof we need. Right,\n"
"Makoto?"
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…
#. 根拠ならあるんだ…！
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Y-yeah, I'm sure of it!"
msgstr ""

#. ふーん。
#. じゃあ、さっさと示してよ。
msgctxt "0056 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Hmm. Okay then, let's see it!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あいつは江ノ島盾子の素性を隠そうとした。
#. それも１回じゃなく、２回もだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He tried to hide Junko's identity. And not just once,\n"
"but twice...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まず最初に、黒幕が隠そうとしたのは、
#. 捜査の時だったはず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The first time was during our latest investigation...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 学園長との<CLT 3>面談を録画したＤＶＤ<CLT>…
#. ボクが視聴覚室で、あれを見てた時…
msgctxt "0060 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"While I was in the A/V room, watching the <CLT 3>DVD of our\n"
"interviews<CLT> with the headmaster..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>モニターだけじゃない。
#. デッキの電源もまとめて切れ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It wasn't just the monitor. The DVD player itself had\n"
"apparently turned off.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もちろん、ＤＶＤは再生をやめた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0062 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Which of course meant that the DVD wasn't playing\n"
"anymore.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. な、なんだ…どうして…？
msgctxt "0063 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wh-What the heck just happened...?"
msgstr ""

#. おっとっと…どうやら故障してしまったようですね。
msgctxt "0064 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Oopsie! Looks like it broke! Out of service!"
msgstr ""

#. は…？　故障…？
#. こんなタイミングで？
msgctxt "0065 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What? It just so happened to break just now...?"
msgstr ""

#. どんなタイミングであろうと、
#. 故障は突然やって来るものなのです。
msgctxt "0066 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Now, then, when, doesn't matter! Failure can strike\n"
"anywhere, anytime!"
msgstr ""

#. なぜなら、それが故障だから！
msgctxt "0067 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "That's what failure IS, right!?"
msgstr ""

#. あの時、お前はわざとＤＶＤを見れなくしたんだ。
#. その理由は…
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You made sure I couldn't finish watching the video.\n"
"And the reason you did that..."
msgstr ""

#. そこに映ってる<CLT 3>“本物の江ノ島盾子”<CLT>の姿を
#. ボクに見られたくなかったからだろう？
msgctxt "0069 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"...is because you didn't want me to see the <CLT 3>real\n"
"Junko<CLT>, did you?"
msgstr ""

#. そうか！　みんなが映ってるＤＶＤなら、
#. 江ノ島っちだって、映ってるはずだべ！
msgctxt "0070 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Oh, yeah! If everyone was in that video, of course\n"
"Junko would've had to show up!"
msgstr ""

#. そこで、苗木が、
#. 本物の江ノ島ちゃんを見ちゃったら…
msgctxt "0071 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "And if Makoto saw the real Junko..."
msgstr ""

#. 私達が最初に会った江ノ島ちゃんが、
#. 偽者だって、バレちゃうからだね！
msgctxt "0072 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"...it would've been totally obvious that the Junko we\n"
"met was an imposter!"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そんなの…ただの偶然だよ…！
msgctxt "0073 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "Th-That whole power outage thing was just a fluke!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、偶然なんかじゃない。
#. あれは確実に黒幕が仕組んだ事だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No, it wasn't a fluke. The mastermind definitely\n"
"orchestrated that power outage...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それに、黒幕が隠そうとした江ノ島盾子の素性は、
#. それだけじゃない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And that's not the only time they tried to hide\n"
"Junko's identity.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あのＤＶＤ以外に黒幕が<CLT><CLT 3>隠そうとした物<CLT><CLT 4>…
#. それを、あいつにぶつけるんだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The mastermind <CLT><CLT 3>tried to cover up<CLT><CLT 4> one other piece of\n"
"evidence. I've gotta reveal that!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
